---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Us
pageClass: about
permalink: /about/
description: Sree Devi Hospital & Fertility Centre on Gandhi Road, Srirangam, has cared for families across Trichy since 8 September 2005. Departments, doctors and registrations.
seoTitle: "About Sree Devi Hospital, Trichy · Since 2005"
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
{%- from "partials/components.njk" import btnCall, btnWhatsApp, doctorPhoto with context -%}
{%- set s = settings -%}
{%- set lead = collections.doctors | where("data.lead", true) -%}
{%- set regs = [] -%}
{%- if s.registrations.clinical_establishment %}{% set regs = (regs.push({ title: "Clinical establishment", text: "Reg. No. " + s.registrations.clinical_establishment }), regs) %}{% endif -%}
{%- if s.registrations.art_clinic %}{% set regs = (regs.push({ title: "ART clinic", text: s.registrations.art_clinic }), regs) %}{% endif -%}

<section class="ab-hero">
  <div class="container ab-hero__grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">About us</p>
      <h1 class="h-hero">Caring for families across Trichy <em>since {{ s.established_year }}</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ s.name }} opened on {{ s.established_date }} to serve the community of Srirangam and Trichy, caring for women and families close to home.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">{{ btnCall() }} {{ btnWhatsApp() }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-collage">
      <div class="ab-collage__arch"><img src="/assets/images/home-hero-building.webp" alt="The hospital building on Gandhi Road, Srirangam"></div>
      <span class="ab-collage__ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="ab-collage__circle"><img src="/assets/images/home-intro-newborn.webp" alt="" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="ab-badge" aria-hidden="true"><div><small>Est.</small><b>{{ s.established_year }}</b></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream ab-story">
  <div class="container ab-story__grid">
    <div class="ab-side"><b>01</b>Our story</div>
    <article>
      <h2 class="h-display h-display--lg">A hospital built around <em>women and families</em></h2>
      <p class="drop">The hospital was started to do right by the community. It opened on Gandhi Road, Srirangam, in {{ s.established_year }} so that families in Srirangam and across Trichy could find good care close to home.</p>
      <p>Today the hospital offers pregnancy and delivery care, a dedicated Fertility Centre, gynaecology and gynaecological surgery, scans and diagnostics, and specialists across {{ departments.items.length }} departments, with emergency and delivery care available 24 hours a day.</p>
      <blockquote class="ab-pull">{{ s.tagline }}.</blockquote>
      <p>From routine check-ups to delivery, surgery and fertility treatment, our teams work together under one roof, so care stays familiar and continuous.</p>
    </article>
    <div class="ab-capsule"><img src="/assets/images/home-intro-consult.webp" alt="A consultation at the hospital" loading="lazy"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ab-numbers" aria-label="Sree Devi in numbers">
  <div class="container ab-numbers__grid">
    <div class="ab-num"><b>{{ s.established_year }}</b><span>The year we opened our doors</span></div>
    <div class="ab-num"><b>{{ departments.items.length }}</b><span>Departments under one roof</span></div>
    <div class="ab-num"><b>24/7</b><span>Emergency and delivery, every day</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--cream">
  <div class="container ab-values__grid">
    <div class="ab-values__intro">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">How we work</span>
      <h2 class="h-display h-display--lg">What you can <em>expect</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">How care works at Sree Devi, from the first call to discharge.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-vgrid">
      <div class="ab-v"><i>i.</i><h3>Care round the clock</h3><p>Emergency and delivery care 24 hours, 7 days, with ICU/HDU, an in-house laboratory open 24 hours and a pharmacy.</p></div>
      <div class="ab-v"><i>ii.</i><h3>Costs explained first</h3><p>Fees are not listed on the website. Reception gives an estimate before your consultation or procedure, and all health insurance is accepted with a cashless facility.</p></div>
      <div class="ab-v"><i>iii.</i><h3>Doctors who explain</h3><p>Clear information, doctors who explain, and a team that guides you through every step.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if lead.length %}{% set d = lead[0].data %}
<section class="section ab-note">
  <div class="container ab-note__grid">
    <div class="ab-portrait">
      <span class="ab-portrait__orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {{ doctorPhoto(d) }}
      <span class="ab-portrait__tag">{{ d.name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">Led by {{ d.name }}</span>
      {%- if d.approach %}
      <span class="qmark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
      <blockquote>{{ d.approach }}</blockquote>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="ab-sig"><span class="line"></span><div><b>{{ d.name }}</b><span>{{ d.qualifications }}{% if d.experience %} · {{ d.experience }} experience{% endif %}</span></div></div>
      <p class="bio">{{ d.bio }}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/doctors/#{{ lead[0].page.fileSlug }}">Meet our doctors {{ icon("arrow", 16) }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section section--peach">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">Departments</span><h2 class="h-display h-display--lg">Specialists across <em>{{ departments.items.length }} departments</em>.</h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="dept-grid">
      {%- for dep in departments.items %}<div class="dept-card"><h3>{{ dep.name }}</h3><p>{{ dep.description }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- if regs.length %}
<section class="section ab-regs">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><span class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">Registrations</span><h2 class="h-display h-display--lg">Registrations &amp; <em>accreditations</em></h2></div><p>Official details, shown for patient reassurance.</p></div>
    <div class="ab-certs">
      {%- for r in regs %}<div class="ab-cert"><div>{{ icon("file", 26) }}<h3>{{ r.title }}</h3><p>{{ r.text }}</p></div></div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section section--cream ab-visit">
  <div class="container ab-visit__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--caps">Visit us</span>
      <h2 class="h-display h-display--lg">Come and <em>meet us</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">Contact the hospital to understand the next steps. This is not an online booking or confirmed appointment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-vcard">
      <div class="ab-vrow">{{ icon("pin", 40) }}<div><b>Address</b>{{ s.address.line1 }}, {{ s.address.line2 }}</div></div>
      <div class="ab-vrow">{{ icon("calendar", 40) }}<div><b>OPD</b>{{ s.timings.opd_days }}. {{ s.timings.sunday }}.</div></div>
      <div class="ab-vrow">{{ icon("clock", 40) }}<div><b>Emergency &amp; delivery</b>{{ s.timings.emergency | capitalize }}</div></div>
      <div class="btn-row">{{ btnCall() }} {{ btnWhatsApp() }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
